  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 9 August 2026</p>

  <h2>Who is responsible for this website</h2>
  <p>{{ site.name }} is operated by True North Labs. For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.author.email }}">{{ site.author.email }}</a>.</p>

  <h2>Information this website handles</h2>
  <p>This website does not use analytics, advertising trackers, contact forms, user accounts, or cookies. It does not collect personal information directly through the website.</p>
  <p>Like any website, requests pass through the hosting and security infrastructure provided by Cloudflare. Technical information such as an IP address, browser details, the requested address, and request time may be processed to deliver and protect the site.</p>
  <p>If you choose to contact us by email, we receive the name, email address, and message that you send.</p>

  <h2>Why information is processed</h2>
  <p>Technical request information is processed only to deliver the website, maintain its security, and diagnose faults. Email information is used to respond to your enquiry, discuss requested services, keep necessary business records, and meet legal obligations.</p>

  <h2>Sharing and retention</h2>
  <p>Website requests are processed by <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare</a> as the hosting and security provider. Email may be processed by the providers used to deliver and store business email. We do not sell personal information or share it for advertising.</p>
  <p>Enquiry emails are kept only for as long as they are useful for the conversation, an ongoing business relationship, or legal and record-keeping requirements. Technical information is retained according to the relevant service provider's operating and security policies.</p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>You may ask what personal information we hold about you, request a correction, or ask us to delete it where no legal obligation requires us to keep it. Depending on where you live, you may also have rights to restrict or object to processing, request a portable copy, or complain to your local privacy regulator.</p>
  <p>To make a request, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.author.email }}">{{ site.author.email }}</a>.</p>
